---
export const prerender = false;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About (K)Need — a cultural and culinary exploration of bread and pastry, told through the bakers who live it.">
  <main class="wf-container py-page">

    <div class="wf-page-head">
      <div class="wf-eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1 class="wf-page-h1">(K)Need is a love letter to good bread.</h1>
      <p class="wf-page-intro">A cultural and culinary exploration of bread and pastry, told through the bakers who live it.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="about-creed">Flour, water, salt.</p>

    <div class="simple-body">
      <p>We believe the best bakeries are more than places to buy bread; they are neighbourhood anchors, living archives of craft, and windows into the people who shape the food we eat.</p>
      <p>Each story is a short portrait of a baker and their space, the early mornings, the flour-dusted hands, the ovens that never cool. We travel across the globe to find the people doing it properly, and we tell their stories with the care they deserve.</p>
    </div>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-creed {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-creed { font-size: 1.4375rem; }
  }
</style>
